    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71897" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄᾰρ-ος</span></b> , ὁ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀαριστύς,</span> mostly in pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θέμιστι . . ὀάρους ὀαρίζει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Hom.</u>
					23.3
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμοὺς</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀάρους καὶ μήτιας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ven.</u>
					249
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρθένιοι ὄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					205
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄ. νυμφᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Lav.Pall.</u>
					66
				</span></i>
			 : generally, <i>converse, discourse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				21.1
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ γὰρ ὄ. λόγοι εἰσί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Min.</u>
					319e
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>lectures,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				9e
			</span></i> P. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>song, ditty,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.137
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάγιος ὄ.</span> an oblique,
			i. e. biassed, <i>song,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>N.</u>
				7.69
			</span></i> : pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.98
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>N.</u>
				3.11
			</span></i> : in later Poets mostly of lovers, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄ. εὐναῖοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.362.16
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυπρίδιοι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				10.68
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Musae.
				132
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
